WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.117 --> 00:00:02.501
(bouncy, energetic music)

00:00:02.501 --> 00:00:04.909
- [Michelle] When I'm
skating with these women,

00:00:04.909 --> 00:00:06.159
I feel on fire.

00:00:08.696 --> 00:00:10.637
I love roller skating so much

00:00:10.637 --> 00:00:14.946
that I decided that I was gonna
bring it back for everyone.

00:00:14.946 --> 00:00:18.856
(bouncy, energetic music)

00:00:18.856 --> 00:00:21.757
I'm Michelle Steilen,
better known as Estro Jen,

00:00:21.757 --> 00:00:24.146
and I'm the Founder of Moxi Roller Skates.

00:00:24.146 --> 00:00:27.919
There are 21 skaters on the
Moxi Skate Team World Wide,

00:00:27.919 --> 00:00:30.322
but some of them are Pigeon,

00:00:30.322 --> 00:00:33.809
Indy Jamma Jones, Smelly and Legs.

00:00:33.809 --> 00:00:37.396
Anything that's experimental
or outside of what you've

00:00:37.396 --> 00:00:41.456
probably seen on roller
skates is what we do.

00:00:41.456 --> 00:00:45.561
Roller skating was really,
really big until I was born,

00:00:45.561 --> 00:00:48.396
and then it really kind of dropped off

00:00:48.396 --> 00:00:50.505
when Rollerblades came in.

00:00:50.505 --> 00:00:53.444
Roller skate innovation just stopped.

00:00:53.444 --> 00:00:55.794
Roller derby was the
next new sport to come

00:00:55.794 --> 00:00:57.875
to the roller skating industry.

00:00:57.875 --> 00:00:59.014
The skates that they were selling

00:00:59.014 --> 00:01:02.423
to roller derby skaters
were made for speed.

00:01:02.423 --> 00:01:04.873
The skates that we're making now are made

00:01:04.873 --> 00:01:08.993
for secure landings
for high flying tricks.

00:01:08.993 --> 00:01:12.081
A few years ago there weren't gals

00:01:12.081 --> 00:01:16.649
doing back flips and on
wheels, and now there are.

00:01:16.649 --> 00:01:20.816
And I'm amazed at what my
body can do, I really am.

00:01:21.911 --> 00:01:23.740
We are chasing our dreams.

00:01:23.740 --> 00:01:26.670
We're chasing that feeling,
that wonderful floaty feeling

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:30.837
of being alive and you will
get that from roller skating.

00:01:33.032 --> 00:01:37.292
It's this strange new
feeling that's refreshing.

00:01:37.292 --> 00:01:40.977
Ah, this is where I'm supposed to be.

00:01:40.977 --> 00:01:42.480
- What, what!

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:44.647
(chiming)

